    to the original ATK of the Tributed monster, until the end of this turn (even
    if this card leaves the field).\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf this card is Normal
    or Special Summoned: You can target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls;
    it loses 1000 ATK for each \"Abyss Actor\" monster you currently control, until
    the end of this turn. When this card destroys an opponent's monster by battle:
    You can target 1 \"Abyss Script\" Spell Card in your Graveyard; Set that card."
